  "headings": [
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "text": "Replace Your Teeth\n& Restore Your\nSelf-Confidence\nin One Day"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "text": "What Does That Mean To You?"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "text": "Ready To Schedule Your Free Consultation?\nOr Need More Information?"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "text": "Specialist Doctors"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "text": "Advanced Technology"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "text": "High Quality Smile in One Day"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "text": "Right In Your Neighborhood"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "text": "Customized Pricing & Financing Options"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "text": "You Love Your GPS Smile"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "text": "Donna’s Success Journey"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "text": "“I felt like my life was over at 57. I didn’t go anywhere or do anything. I used to love eating and spending time with friends… that all ended. Then one day I saw a TV ad for Dental Implants GPS. It honestly was the best"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "text": "Before GPS:"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "text": "Couldn’t Eat"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "text": "Had Issues Socializing"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "text": "Felt Old"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "text": "After GPS:"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "text": "Back on the Court Smiling"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "text": "Laughing"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "text": "Loving Life"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "text": "If you answered YES to any of the above, your teeth may be the cause. It is time to get answers."
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "text": "Are your teeth painful or do they move?"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "text": "Do you have pain in your mouth?"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "text": "Do you cover your smile when talking?"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "text": "Is eating difficult?"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "text": "Do your teeth cause you embarrassment or mental pain?"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "text": "Do you feel ill or tired?"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "text": "At Dental Implants GPS, we believe where you go for treatment does matter."
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "text": "Our Doctors are leaders in their field, the highest caliber of Board certified Oral and Maxillofacial Surgeons."
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "text": "The GPS Team has partnerships with over a hundred local general dentists who trust their patients to our team."
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "text": "Patients travel from all over the country to visit our advanced Dental Implant Centers."
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "text": "Any clinic that displays generic fees is giving you a generic treatment plan. That’s why we offer a Free Consultation."
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "text": "YOU CAN’T PUT A PRICE ON YOUR HEALTH!"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "text": "Whether you’re paying in full, making payments, or need financing our specialists will help find an affordable payment plan that fits your budget."
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "text": "We believe Our Guided Patient Success system is the difference you are looking for. The care you Deserve."
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "text": "Our Clinical Team is lead by our founding Doctors. Oral and Maxillofacial Surgical Specialists and Medical Doctors."
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "text": "Eric Baker, DDS, MD"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "text": "Tim Betita, DDS, MD"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "text": "Tina H"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "text": "Fantastic experience. The office was able to get us in the same day. We scheduled the tooth extraction within three weeks. The staff was responsive and nice. Dr. Pfeiffer was so caring with my ten year old and made him f"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "text": "Irma Bibbs"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "text": "Show nothing but love for their patients! They don’t judge you just help you with your confidence and\nbeautiful smile."
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "text": "Andrea Almanza"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "text": "Dr Baker and his team in the Riverside office are ABSOLUTELY AMAZING!!! I am FOREVER thankful. I spent two years researching, going to consultations and I never felt comfortable with anyone or any place. The moment I wal"
    },
    {
