  "text": "GUIDED PATIENT SUCCESS\n\n(866) 580-2051\nReplace Your Teeth\n& Restore Your\nSelf-Confidence\nin One Day \n\nWith the GPS Solution!\n\nCALL NOW\nGET PRICING\nWhat Does That Mean To You?\nReady To Schedule Your Free Consultation?\nOr Need More Information?\nNEAREST OFFICE LOCATION: *\nRESEDA\nDANA POINT\nTUSTIN\nRIVERSIDE\nWEST COVINA\nPALMDALE\nBAKERSFIELD\nHUNTINGTON BEACH\nHow are you currently covered for healthcare?\nMedicare\nMedi-Cal\nMedicaid\nMedical Benefits through Employer\nNo Insurance Coverage\nSelf Employed\nGET PRICING\n\nPlus, we are the Only Center with Your Success Right in the Name\n\nSpecialist Doctors\nAdvanced Technology\nHigh Quality Smile in One Day\nRight In Your Neighborhood\nCustomized Pricing & Financing Options\nYou Love Your GPS Smile\nDonna’s Success Journey\n“I felt like my life was over at 57. I didn’t go anywhere or do anything. I used to love eating and spending time with friends… that all ended. Then one day I saw a TV ad for Dental Implants GPS. It honestly was the best thing I have ever done for my health and happiness. I love my Dentist. Who says that!”\nBefore GPS:\nCouldn’t Eat\nHad Issues Socializing\nFelt Old\nAfter GPS:\nBack on the Court Smiling\nLaughing\nLoving Life\n\nWatch The Entire Journey To Success\n\nFollow Kelicia through her Dental Implants GPS journey to a beautiful new smile in just one day.\n\nHow To Know If You Need To Replace All Of Your Teeth.\n\nIf you answered YES to any of the above, your teeth may be the cause. It is time to get answers.\nGET PRICING\nAre your teeth painful or do they move?\nDo you have pain in your mouth?\nDo you cover your smile when talking?\nIs eating difficult?\nDo your teeth cause you embarrassment or mental pain?\nDo you feel ill or tired? \n\nWhy Is GPS The Right Choice?\n\nAt Dental Implants GPS, we believe where you go for treatment does matter.\nOur Doctors are leaders in their field, the highest caliber of Board certified Oral and Maxillofacial Surgeons.\nThe GPS Team has partnerships with over a hundred local general dentists who trust their patients to our team.\nPatients travel from all over the country to visit our advanced Dental Implant Centers.\nAny clinic that displays generic fees is giving you a generic treatment plan. That’s why we offer a Free Consultation.\nYOU CAN’T PUT A PRICE ON YOUR HEALTH!\nWhether you’re paying in full, making payments, or need financing our specialists will help find an affordable payment plan that fits your budget. \n\nVisit The GPS Team\n\nWe believe Our Guided Patient Success system is the difference you are looking for. The care you Deserve.\nOur Clinical Team is lead by our founding Doctors. Oral and Maxillofacial Surgical Specialists and Medical Doctors.\nEric Baker, DDS, MD\nTim Betita, DDS, MD\n\nSee What Real Patients Think Of GPS.\n\nTina H\nFantastic experience. The office was able to get us in the same day. We scheduled the tooth extraction within three weeks. The staff was responsive and nice. Dr. Pfeiffer was so caring with my ten year old and made him feel so comfortable through the whole process. I wish every office was like this one. \nIrma Bibbs\nShow nothing but love for their patients! They don’t judge you just help you with your confidence and\nbeautiful smile. \n\nAndrea Almanza\nDr Baker and his team in the Riverside office are ABSOLUTELY AMAZING!!! I am FOREVER thankful. I spent two years researching, going to consultations and I never felt comfortable with anyone or any place. The moment I walked in the door I was treated with warmth and kindness. I’ve never felt unsure, uncomfortable, or pressured at any time to move forward. There are a lot of dental implant places out there that made me feel like I was “buying a car”. Dr Baker and his team NEVER made me feel unsure of anything … \n\nThank You Dr Baker and the entire Riverside office for everything. You have changed my life forever  \n\nDental Implants GPS Locations\nReseda:\n\n18040 Sherman Way,\nSuite 330\nReseda, CA 91335 \n\nCALL LOCATION\n\nRiverside: \n\n6848 Magnolia\nSuite 100\nRiverside, CA 92506\n\nCALL LOCATION\n\nWest Covina:\n\n1000 Lakes Drive,\nSuite 150\nWest Covina, CA 91790\n\nCALL LOCATION\n\nTustin:\n\n3053 Edinger,\nTustin, CA 92780\n\nCALL LOCATION\n\nPalmdale:\n\n655 W Ave Q\nSuite E\nPalmdale, CA 93351\n\nCALL LOCATION\n\nDana Point :\n\n32241 Crown Valley Pkwy\nSuite 220\nDana Point, CA 92629\n\nCALL LOCATION\n\nDental Implant Treatment The GPS Way\nReplace Your Teeth and Restore Your Confidence with permanent full-mouth dental implant treatments from a leader in full-mouth restorations.\nThis Is What We Do Every Single Day.\n\nOur Specialist team uses our technologically advanced system to turn a patient with terminal teeth into a renewed person who can eat, laugh, chew and socialize with freedom.\n\nWhether you’re missing a few teeth or all of your teeth, dental Implants act like the roots of lost teeth to provide a stable support for a full set of zirconia teeth which are the most durable, beautiful and functional. \n\nA Reason To Smile\n\nGET PRICING\nBakersfield: \n\n8800 Stockdale Hwy\nSuite 150\nBakersfield, CA 93311\n\nCALL LOCATION"
